+<!ATTLIST EncoderProfile fileFormat (mp4|3gp) #REQUIRED>
+<!ATTLIST EncoderProfile duration (30|60) #REQUIRED>
+<!ATTLIST EncoderProfile cameraId (0|1) #REQUIRED>
